{"4094800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Quill & Sword: Fate of Eryndor", "steam_appid": 4094800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quill &amp; Sword: Fate of Eryndor</strong> is a <strong>fantasy grand strategy game</strong> where diplomacy, warfare, and ambition collide. Rule as a human king, dwarven thane, elven archon, or orc warlord—each with unique strengths, cultures, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your realm’s economy, command armies across provinces, and negotiate alliances or betrayals that will reshape the map. Expand your influence through <strong>tactical warfare</strong>, <strong>political maneuvering</strong>, and <strong>resource management</strong>, or seek peace through trade and diplomacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>Eryndor</strong> is alive and ever-changing—kingdoms rise and fall, borders shift, and every decision carries weight. Will your realm endure through cunning and steel, or be forgotten beneath the banners of others?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your legacy—one quill stroke and sword swing at a time.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quill &amp; Sword: Fate of Eryndor</strong> is a <strong>fantasy grand strategy game</strong> where diplomacy, warfare, and ambition collide. Rule as a human king, dwarven thane, elven archon, or orc warlord—each with unique strengths, cultures, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your realm’s economy, command armies across provinces, and negotiate alliances or betrayals that will reshape the map. Expand your influence through <strong>tactical warfare</strong>, <strong>political maneuvering</strong>, and <strong>resource management</strong>, or seek peace through trade and diplomacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra